:[{\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Diluição\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Diluir antes da administração. A rotulagem consultada orienta preparo em dextrose 5% ou em solução de cloreto de sódio que contenha 5% de dextrose; solução salina isolada não é recomendada para essa apresentação concentrada.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Acesso venoso\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Infundir em veia calibrosa e verificar frequentemente o local de infusão para reduzir o risco de extravasamento e necrose tecidual.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Estabilidade / compatibilidade\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"A solução diluída pode ser mantida por até 24 horas em temperatura ambiente, protegida da luz. Evitar contato com sais de ferro, álcalis ou agentes oxidantes.\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"es\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Dilución\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Diluir antes de administrar. El rotulado consultado indica preparación en dextrosa al 5% o en solución de cloruro de sodio que contenga 5% de dextrosa; la solución salina sola no se recomienda para esta presentación concentrada.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Acceso venoso\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Infundir en una vena de buen calibre y comprobar frecuentemente el sitio de infusión para reducir el riesgo de extravasación y necrosis tisular.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Estabilidad / compatibilidad\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"La solución diluida puede mantenerse hasta 24 horas a temperatura ambiente, protegida de la luz. Evitar contacto con sales de hierro, álcalis o agentes oxidantes.\\\\\\\"}]},\\\\\\\"referencias\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"pt\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DailyMed — Norepinephrine Bitartrate Injection\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Fonte oficial/regulatória consultada em 24/08/2026 para Administração/Preparo.\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"es\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"label\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DailyMed — Norepinephrine Bitartrate Injection\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Fuente oficial/regulatoria consultada el 24/08/2026 para Administración/Preparación.\\\\\\\"}]}},\\\\\\\"sources\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"stage\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"A_BATCH04\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"dailymed_norepinephrine_4408987e\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"DailyMed — Norepinephrine Bitartrate Injection\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=4408987e-690a-41ac-9677-e24604fa9793\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reviewed_at\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2026-08-24\\\\\\\"}]},\\\\\\\"mc_gold_standard_v1\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"PASS_CLINICAL_HOMOLOGATION\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sourceOwner\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"database/emergencia.js\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sourceField\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"noradrenalina.mcGoldClinicalV1\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"lote\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"056\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"requiredFields\\\\\\\":33,\\\\\\\"approvedSha256\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"498cafa4e0fbd5a28b86b77472df89a94eaa0fa96bde0eb3b706fdf18d0e7236\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"calculationAuthorized\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"publicationAuthorized\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"clinicalPackagePublicationState\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BLOQUEADA\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"ownerPublicationAuthorization\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"lote002-owner-confirmed\\\\\\\"}}\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"# Noradrenalina\\\\n\\\\n## Classe\\\\n\\\\nVasopressor agonista alfa-adrenérgico predominante\\\\n\\\\n## Classe farmacológica\\\\n\\\\nVasopressor agonista alfa-adrenérgico predominante\\\\n\\\\n## Nomes comerciais\\\\n\\\\nMarcas variam por país.\\\\n\\\\n## Apresentação\\\\n\\\\nConcentrados e bolsas prontas em concentrações diversas; não inferir equivalência.\\\\n\\\\n## Apresentações\\\\n\\\\nConcentrados e bolsas prontas em concentrações diversas; não inferir equivalência.\\\\n\\\\n## Mecanismo\\\\n\\\\nMecanismo específico da classe conforme fonte primária e formulação.\\\\n\\\\n## Farmacodinâmica\\\\n\\\\nMecanismo específico da classe conforme fonte primária e formulação.\\\\n\\\\n## Farmacocinética\\\\n\\\\nRevisar absorção, metabolismo, meia-vida e eliminação na fonte primária.\\\\n\\\\n## Indicações\\\\n\\\\nRestauração da pressão arterial em hipotensão aguda grave após correção adequada da hipovolemia.\\\\n\\\\n## Posologia de referência\\\\n\\\\nInfusão IV titulada à meta hemodinâmica. Rótulos históricos iniciam 8-12 microgramas/min e mantêm 2-4 microgramas/min, mas protocolos por peso e concentrações variam; exigir concentração, acesso, bomba e monitorização explícitos.\\\\n\\\\n## Pediatria\\\\n\\\\nRequer tabela completa por idade/peso; automação pediátrica bloqueada.\\\\n\\\\n## Função renal\\\\n\\\\nAvaliar função renal e tabela específica; não inferir ajuste.\\\\n\\\\n## Função hepática\\\\n\\\\nAvaliar hepatopatia; não inferir ajuste.\\\\n\\\\n## Efeitos adversos comuns\\\\n\\\\nIsquemia periférica, ansiedade, cefaleia, dispneia e bradicardia reflexa.\\\\n\\\\n## Efeitos adversos graves\\\\n\\\\nArritmias, isquemia/necrose, extravasamento, hipertensão grave e redução de perfusão de órgãos.\\\\n\\\\n## Efeitos adversos\\\\n\\\\nIsquemia periférica, ansiedade, cefaleia, dispneia e bradicardia reflexa.; Arritmias, isquemia/necrose, extravasamento, hipertensão grave e redução de perfusão de órgãos.\\\\n\\\\n## Contraindicações\\\\n\\\\nHipersensibilidade e contraindicações específicas da bula.\\\\n\\\\n## Interações\\\\n\\\\nRevisar interações farmacodinâmicas e metabólicas aplicáveis.\\\\n\\\\n## Monitorização\\\\n\\\\nMonitorar eficácia, tolerabilidade, função orgânica e eventos graves.\\\\n\\\\n## Administração\\\\n\\\\nUsar somente via/formulação rotulada; respeitar técnica e alimentos.\\\\n\\\\n## Preparo\\\\n\\\\nConfirmar concentração, diluição e estabilidade no produto; não inferir.\\\\n\\\\n## Infusão\\\\n\\\\nQuando IV, usar bomba/monitorização e protocolo da bula; caso contrário não aplicável.\\\\n\\\\n## Gestação\\\\n\\\\nAvaliar risco fetal, indicação e bula.\\\\n\\\\n## Lactação\\\\n\\\\nAvaliar excreção e risco-benefício.\\\\n\\\\n## Populações especiais\\\\n\\\\nIndivid